            "review_text": "Per H\nCopenhagen, Denmark790 contributions\n0\nFantastic food\nFeb 2024 • Couples\nWe had already been to a different Indian restaurant twice (other side of river) but it was not 100% so we searched for another and found this one. \nWe ordered Chicken Madras, Daal, garlic Nan, samosas (lamb) and garlic rice. I asked for the Chicken Madras to be “Indian spicy” as I hate the watered down version that tourists like.\nWe were more than satisfied all the food was cooked perfectly and had the right amount of flavor. \nWould recommend this restaurant and if time permits we will be back.\nRead more\nWritten February 26, 2024",
